You sense the presence of minor spoilers --more--

By "everything", I mean that you have also forgotten about any
scrolls, potions, armor, tools, and spellbooks you have discovered so
far, e.g., that potion of levitation will afterwards be referred to as
a blue (or whatever) potion, just as if you had started the game anew.

When you read a scroll of amnesia, you get the message, "Thinking of
Maud, you forget everything else".  When you have thus lost your
memory, and when you read *another* scroll of amnesia, there is
nothing to forget, and the game prints, "Who was that Maud person
anyway?", i.e., you have forgotten about Maud as well, except her
name.

